Homepage: https://moonlight-stream.org

Package: moonlight-qt
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends},
 qml6-module-qtquick, qml6-module-qtquick-controls, qml6-module-qtquick-templates,
 qml6-module-qtquick-layouts, qml6-module-qtquick-window, qml6-module-qtqml-workerscript,
 qt6-wayland, qt6-svg-plugins
Description: game streaming client for GameStream and Sunshine
 Moonlight streams games and the desktop from a PC that runs NVIDIA
 GameStream or Sunshine. It decodes the stream with hardware acceleration
 (VA-API, VDPAU, Vulkan) where the GPU supports it.
